WEBVTT

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.195
It sounds like an infection, at best.

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:02.576
Maybe a medical instrument.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.360
"Hurry, nurse, bring the vagina!"

00:02:04.384 --> 00:02:05.445
(Laughter)

00:02:05.469 --> 00:02:07.040
Vagina, vagina, vagina.

00:02:07.064 --> 00:02:09.603
It doesn't matter how many times
you say the word,

00:02:09.627 --> 00:02:11.976
it never sounds like a word
you want to say.

00:02:12.307 --> 00:02:16.482
It's a completely ridiculous,
totally un-sexy word.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.071
If you use it during sex,
trying to be politically correct,

00:02:20.095 --> 00:02:23.306
"Darling, would you stroke my vagina,"

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.423
you kill the act right there.

00:02:25.447 --> 00:02:27.117
(Laughter)

00:02:27.141 --> 00:02:30.439
I'm worried what we call them
and don't call them.